/**
 * @defgroup logger_borrowers_api Logger borrower API
 * @ingroup logger_api
 * @brief Borrower-facing API for the `logger` port.
 *
 * @details
 * Exposes the runtime operations available to modules that borrow a `logger`
 * instance through its opaque handle.
 *
 * Borrowers may emit log messages through the provided handle but do not own
 * it and are therefore not responsible for its initialization or destruction.
 */
